<title>POLAND: Budimex to assimilate registered shares.</title>
<headline>Budimex to assimilate registered shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA will on December 3 assimilate 301,230 registered shares into common shares for bourse trade, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Budimex said the move would follow the shares' conversion on December 2 by the National Securities Depository (KDPW) and that the firm would then have 8,337,597 shares on the Warsaw bourse.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
